437557", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8f1b2fbc/uploads/origins/eda6f085-6408-4efe-89ef-47e3644006dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f498ac0d08d15c847f39ee476b437557, https://si.imgix.net/8f1b2fbc/uploads/origins/eda6f085-6408-4efe-89ef-47e3644006dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=65cbee46726576a520a5ab5cdad8fd5d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8f1b2fbc/uploads/origins/eda6f085-6408-4efe-89ef-47e3644006dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9a65ff9f107b402286c263fcea30b13d 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I really love the atmosphere of your art! Can I request my OC in a tea party? She is a gloomy undead rose girl around 10 years old. https://toyhou.se/1266678.emrys\nThe tea party is in my OC's dreams, so I would like elements indicating that it is not reality. Being at a tea party in cute lolita clothing has always been her dreams, but she is stuck eternally in a haunted forest. I would like her to look happy with a gentle smile.\nFeel free to design a lolita dress for her. If you prefer not to, you can use this outfit instead.\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1qL07-0FQx3xsgJdT2byA_euIaLYbNqJR/view?usp=sharing\nIf you have any unused drafts, I would be grateful if you can also include it in the PDF.\nThank you for considering!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@_____hokanko/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3747021, "client_id": 3840857, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9dc533b1/uploads/origins/c3e4a4f9-e3f2-4586-915b-a008caf16a41?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8630686e00e8b2cfddcf5259a3fa20a3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9dc533b1/uploads/origins/c3e4a4f9-e3f2-4586-915b-a008caf16a41?bg=%23fff&aut